Cancellation now kills remaining group members even after the leader exits.
My previous fix reaped the leader too early and disarmed the group guard while
members were still alive; the original item 2 conclusion is superseded here.
The previously verified E1b features are retained. This rework changes production
behavior only in src/process.rs; src/gateway/mod.rs adds a test module only.
Other changes are the specifically requested test/model refinements, inventories
and evidence. No protocol, store, provider, policy, tool or frontend behavior
was changed in this focused rework. Original scope authorities d1174/d1372 and
Architect baseline amendments remain unchanged.

